flowchart TD
    Start([User selects<br/>publication]) --> Pub[GET /api/publications/current]
    Pub --> Geo[GeographyCard<br/>location + coordinates]
    Pub --> Coll[CollectionEventCard<br/>collection parameters]
    Pub --> Tax[TaxonomyCard<br/>taxonomic classification]
    Pub --> Quan[QuantitiesCard<br/>quantitative characteristics]
    Pub --> Art[ArticleSourceCard<br/>publication info]

    Geo & Coll & Tax & Quan & Art --> Auto{Autosave?}

    Auto -->|2s debounce| Save[PUT /api/records/id<br/>submission_type=autosave]
    Auto -->|Manual save| Save

    Save --> Submit[PUT /api/records/id/submit]
    Submit --> Valid[validate_record<br/>5 rule modules]
    Valid --> Ok[REC_OK]
    Ok --> Sidebar[View in FormSidebar]
    Ok --> Export[Export XLSX<br/>/api/records/export]
